    "body": "Related, in step 12 of attempt to populate the history entry's document  what is `request`? \r\n\r\n> If entry's [document state](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#she-document-state)'s [request referrer](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#document-state-request-referrer) is \"client\", then set it to request's [referrer](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-request-referrer).\r\n\r\nIt seems out of place. Step 13 checks if entry's document state is non-null before manipulating it. As far as I can tell, there is no `request` in this algorithm at all.",
